  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "PROJECT OUTPOST: SIGNAL LOST\nIT 402W Final Project \u2013 Bulacan State
    University\nTeam: [Insert team names]\n\nBuilt with Unity 6 (Universal Render
    Pipeline).\n\n\nTEXTURES, SKY AND MODELS \u2013 Poly Haven (polyhaven.com), CC0
    public domain\nTextures: Aerial Grass Rock, Brown Mud Leaves 01, Rocky Terrain
    02, Coast Sand Rocks 02, Concrete Floor Worn 001, Concrete Wall 008, Metal Plate\nSky:
    Belfast Sunset (Pure Sky)\nModels: Boulder 01, Rock Moss Set 01, Barrel 01, Wooden
    Crate 01, Wooden Military Crate, Medical Box, Metal Jerrycan, Power Box 01, Utility
    Box 01, Caged Hanging Light, Industrial Caged Sconce, Steel Frame Shelves 01,
    Portable Generator, Vintage Radio Transceiver, Modular Chainlink Fence\n\nAUDIO
    \u2013 OpenGameArt (opengameart.org), CC0 public domain\n\"Boss Battle (loop)\"
    by pro-sensory \u2013 boss music\n\"50 CC0 Sci-Fi SFX\" by rubberduck \u2013
    weapon, laser and alarm sounds\n\"100 CC0 SFX\" by rubberduck \u2013 impacts,
    explosions and interface sounds\n\"Different steps on wood, stone, leaves, gravel
    and mud\" by TinyWorlds \u2013 footsteps\nSiren, radio static, crackle, hum,
    servo, alert beep, stomp and click sounds were generated for this project (public
    domain)\n\nUNITY ASSET STORE (Asset Store EULA)\nSci-Fi Robots Bundle (Robert,
    Engie) \u2013 Same Gev Dudios\nSci-fi Pistol [PBR] \u2013 StarGames studio\nConifers
    [BOTD] \u2013 forst\nParticle Pack \u2013 Unity Technologies\nFree Laser Weapons
    \u2013 Daniel SoundsGood\nSci-Fi Music Loops Pack \u2013 Robson Cozendey (\"Cut
    Scene\" for exploration, \"Space Battle\" for combat)\n\nSKETCHFAB \u2013 CC
    BY 4.0\nBuster Drone \u2013 LaVADraGoN\nYellow Heavy Robot 8K \u2013 Martark\nSmall
    Motorboat \u2013 Tijmen Matthys\nBattery cell model \u2013 Sketchfab (author
    and license to be confirmed)\nCartridge Fuse model \u2013 Sketchfab (author and
    license to be confirmed)\n\nANIMATION, UI AND FONTS\nMixamo animations \u2013
    Adobe (royalty-free)\nFantasy UI Borders \u2013 Kenney (kenney.nl), CC0\nRajdhani
    font \u2013 Indian Type Foundry (SIL Open Font License)\nLiberation Sans (TextMesh
    Pro default) \u2013 SIL Open Font License\n"
